	(text "DISSOLVED OXYGEN (isolated side)\nU2 Atlas DO OEM: I2C addr 0x67, VCC 3.0-5.5 V (about 2.5 mA at 3.3 V), from VDD_ISO (NXE1S0303MC, about 3.0-3.3 V).\nSDA/SCL pulled up on the Isolation sheet (R3/R4 4.7k): no pull-ups here. INT goes to test pad J5 only; firmware polls register 0x07.\nProbe: galvanic DO probe on J1 SMA (Atlas ENV-40-DOX, male SMA). PRB (pin 4) to J1 centre, PRB GND (pin 5) to J1 shell.\nLayout (DO datasheet p31): probe traces on top, 0.4 mm, as short as possible, 1 mm from other traces, GND_ISO plane (pin 6)\nunder and around the probe traces and connector on all layers, no vias or exposed copper under U2.\nR5 0R DNP: optional PRB GND to GND_ISO link for bring-up."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
